<title>USA: U.S. Rentals prices IPO at $20/shr.</title>
<headline>U.S. Rentals prices IPO at $20/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MODESTO, Calif. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Rentals Inc said Thursday it has priced its initial public offering of 10 million shares at $20 per share.</p>
<p>U.S. Rentals said it will use the net proceeds to retire substantially all of its outstanding indebtedness.</p>
</text>
